{"version":1,"content":"<p>港珠澳大橋正式開通八周年，據央視新聞報道，截至今日（22日）零時，經港珠澳大橋珠海公路口岸往來粵港澳三地的旅客數量超過1.25億人次，車輛超過2645萬輛次。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:37:37.851463+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:14:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T10:38:03.984486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:37:37.851463+00:00","content_hash":"1051eeb00098efb878a02e1fe8227a9e6c5bc61587a55a6ea612370cd4563ff6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}